{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voidloop is a mining adventure with roguelite elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a lonely Void Spirit who has wandered too far from home. Use your camp as a hub to prepare for each descent into ever-changing caves filled with rare loot and dangerous foes. Each dive brings you closer to your home at bottom of the cave...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descend through 5 unique cave biomes,</strong> each filled with procedurally generated floors, unique hazards, and valuable resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race against time</strong> as you push toward floor 20 of each cave to collect powerful gems and find your way back to the void.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Return to camp between runs</strong> to trade, craft, and upgrade your spirit with the help of the Blacksmith, Shopkeeper, and Witch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine, fight, and loot</strong> over 60+ unique items, then progress your journey with 100+ upgrades and 27 powerful skills that make you stronger each run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803180/extras/9454445f95d82fa92a229910eb702636.avif?t=1774381238\" width=960 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803180/extras/bd843b1ecf3e0dd9fa440c4c0573b93f.poster.avif?t=1774381238\" width=960 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803180/extras/bd843b1ecf3e0dd9fa440c4c0573b93f.webm?t=1774381238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803180/extras